{"id":"fabbb72b95296700","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-prefix-products.md","title":"前缀自由代码的有限串拼接幂","display":"df-prefix-products — 前缀自由代码的有限串拼接幂","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-prefix-products","aliases":["20-df-prefix-products"],"display":"df-prefix-products — 前缀自由代码的有限串拼接幂","chapter":"11","section":"11.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Theorem 11.3.2 的 Vₙ 构造","source_printed_pages":[192],"source_pdf_pages":[223],"depends_on":["[[20-df-strings]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-prefix-products"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-prefix-products</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-prefix-products — 前缀自由代码的有限串拼接幂"},{"key":"chapter","html":"11"},{"key":"section","html":"11.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 11.3.2 的 Vₙ 构造"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>192</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>223</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(P\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 前缀自由且不含空串；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prefix-products}\\vdash\nP^{\\langle0\\rangle}:=\\{\\varnothing\\},\\qquad P^{\\langle n+1\\rangle}:=\\{\\sigma^\\frown\\tau:\\sigma\\in P^{\\langle n\\rangle},\\tau\\in P\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prefix-products}\\vdash\nP^{\\langle0\\rangle}:=\\{\\varnothing\\},\\qquad P^{\\langle n+1\\rangle}:=\\{\\sigma^\\frown\\tau:\\sigma\\in P^{\\langle n\\rangle},\\tau\\in P\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>同一长度的代码串拼接数有唯一逐段解析，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 前缀自由。该幂符号区别于集合笛卡尔幂及跳跃。如果 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=\\varnothing\">\\(P=\\varnothing\\)</span>，所有正次幂为空。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 11.3.2 的 Vₙ 构造；印刷页 192；PDF 第 223 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prefix-products}\\vdash\nP^{\\langle0\\rangle}:=\\{\\varnothing\\},\\qquad P^{\\langle n+1\\rangle}:=\\{\\sigma^\\frown\\tau:\\sigma\\in P^{\\langle n\\rangle},\\tau\\in P\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"P=\\varnothing","display":false}],"bytes":1174,"backlinks":[{"id":"6012ed8c9d9b861e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-prefix-products]]；see [[20-df-cantor-measure]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-155","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-prefix-products]] — 章 11；直接提供者 1 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-155","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-prefix-products]]"}],"outgoing":["755e421576224435"]}